MushafDatabase-Ligature-Based-SVG/

# a local clone of quran-ws/quran-assets, symlinked in so the demo's ornament
# section can be developed against the full 8-mushaf set. The demo ships only
# the one-mushaf fallback that build.py vendors into docs/demo/data/ornaments/.
docs/demo/ornaments

# derived: per-page flag files from tools/audit_marks.py
.cache/marks_pages/

# Defect working material: sweeps, flag dumps, review sheets and the eye
# reports behind them. It is the record of a hunt that is now closed — the
# figures inside describe builds three fixes old (PROCESS.md still reads
# "762 flagged words, 216 pages clean, SCORE 77"; the marktype rules doc still
# counts small_meem 1,462 where the iqlab rework leaves 609). Publishing stale
# defect data invites someone to act on it. Every file is preserved in
# origin/archive/pre-rewrite and can be restored into a working tree from there;
# the generators that write these files ARE tracked.
docs/defects/
docs/PROCESS.md
.DS_Store

# A label-review session log from 2026-08: 467 before/after lines written in
# the pre-rename vocabulary (fatha, kasra, shadda, two-dots). Nothing reads it,
# and the decisions it records were folded into .cache/marks/labels.json long
# ago. Kept out of the published tree; recoverable from git history.
.cache/review/face_changes.jsonl
